# Live-verified end-to-end 2026-10-04. Two saved tunes (Chime, Gong) in
# the Tune picker: whichever one is currently SELECTED expands to 2 lines
# (name + its wrapped pattern text), while the other stays collapsed with
# just a trailing "*" marker - confirmed the expansion follows the
# selection cursor as it moves from Chime to Gong.
#
# Keys: TestClearAlarms=10008, TestAlarmIndex=10009, TestAlarmHour=10010,
# TestAlarmMinute=10011, TestAlarmName=10020, TestClearTunes=10040,
# TestTuneIndex=10041, TestTuneName=10042, TestTuneCustomPattern=10043
